Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Materials and light. Kuch materials light ko pass karte, kuch thoda pass karte, aur kuch rok dete hain. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:01:02.154
Clear glass transparent, tracing paper translucent, aur thick cardboard opaque hota hai. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
